WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.933
<v SPEAKER 1>HI, THANKS FOR MAKING TIME. CAN YOU HEAR ME?

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:06.067
<v SPEAKER 2>YES, ALL GOOD.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.067
<v SPEAKER 1>SO, ABOUT FOLAKE TREVELYAN.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:14.467
<v SPEAKER 2>RIGHT. FOLAKE HAS BEEN STRUGGLING SINCE THE MOVE TO NEW ARDLEY.

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:20.600
<v SPEAKER 1>WE'RE CONSIDERING A PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENT PLAN AND POSSIBLY TERMINATION.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.000
<v SPEAKER 2>OKAY. THEIR SALARY IS 24 MILLION DOLLARS, RIGHT?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.200
<v SPEAKER 1>YES, PLUS A 2.5% BONUS TARGET.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.733
<v SPEAKER 2>AND HAMZA HALVORSEN WOULD BACKFILL?

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:37.333
<v SPEAKER 1>POSSIBLY. DON'T MENTION THE RESTRUCTURING OF THE BLUEFIN TEAM YET.

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:39.267
<v SPEAKER 2>UNDERSTOOD.

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:44.733
<v SPEAKER 1>SEND NOTES TO BRAM.LACHANCE@INBOX.INVALID, NOT THE SHARED INBOX.

00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:47.867
<v SPEAKER 2>WILL DO. HAVE A GOOD WEEKEND.

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:49.600
<v SPEAKER 1>YOU TOO.
